<title>UK: Hays shares rise as UBS repeats &quot;buy&quot;.</title>
<headline>Hays shares rise as UBS repeats &quot;buy&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in business services group Hays Plc rose 13-1/2 pence to 538-1/2 as broker UBS repeated its &quot;buy&quot; recommendation, a dealer said.</p>
<p>&quot;The stocks have had a dull performance recently,&quot; he added without giving further details.</p>
<p>Hays shares have trended downwards since mid-February when they reached a 12-month high of 575-1/2 pence.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
